Rule 20 (if s is given, the last two dimensions' size should be equal to s's elements)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tuple(int)} |= if v_2.len = 2 then shape(v_1, ndim(v_1) - 2) = v_2[0] ∧ shape(v_1, ndim(v_1) - 1) = v_2[1]
